{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05209","headline":"奉和受图温洛应制 · 牛凤及","name":"奉和受图温洛应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八神扶玉辇，六羽警瑶谿。\n戒道伊川北，通津涧水西。\n御图开洛匮，刻石与天齐。\n瑞日波中上，仙禽雾里低。\n微臣矫羽翮，拚舞接鸾鷖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛凤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}